      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SHE'S FULL ON (8) jumps from box 8 again after finishing a 5.5 lengths second (23.87) last time at this track over 407m. Solid beginner and with a good start should have clear running out wide. Has the ability and expected to go close. FARMOR MYSTIC (3) was in the money last time at this track (24.10) in a Grade 5, finishing a 3 length second. Already a winner from this draw. Can feature in the finish. POOKIE BEAR (7) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing fourth (24.27) last time in a Grade 5 at this track. Safe beginner but wide box to overcome and will need some luck. Better than last start and can bounce back. CANYA AZURE (4) comes into calculations after placing in a quick run most recently.",
